# Monorepo layout

- `apps/web` (`@dj/web`) — Next.js UI deployable (port 3000)
- `apps/api` (`@dj/api`) — Next.js API deployable (port 3001)
- `packages/*` (`@dj/db`, `@dj/graph`, `@dj/notes`, `@dj/ui`) — shared libraries

Put deployable apps under `apps/`. Put shared domain/UI libraries under `packages/`. Import `@dj/*` from apps; do not duplicate domain logic inside app folders.
